const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"难题是能否同时解释两种收益",en:"The puzzle is explaining two returns together"},body:{zh:"Mehra与Prescott比较美国长期股票收益与短期近乎无风险债务收益，问标准模型能否同时产生这种差距和较低无风险利率。它不是简单问股票是否比债券波动大，也不是看到历史溢价就断言未来必定获得同样补偿。",en:"Mehra and Prescott ask whether a standard model can jointly explain the historical equity premium and low risk-free return. The question goes beyond whether stocks fluctuate more than bills. A historical premium is not a promise of the same compensation in the future."},reference:{url:"https://academicwebpages.com/preview/mehra/pdf/The%20Equity%20Premium%20A%20Puzzle.pdf",label:{zh:"1985年期刊版 · §1",en:"1985 journal article · §1"}}},{title:{zh:"代表性家庭与交换经济限定了问题",en:"The representative household and exchange economy delimit the question"},body:{zh:"模型采用代表性家庭、不可储存的消费品与随机禀赋增长，股票索取这项产出的支付。这样的结构便于推导均衡价格，但并不包含所有真实家庭的收入、借贷限制与资产配置差异。对该模型的困难不能直接写成对所有经济理论的否定。",en:"A representative household values consumption in an exchange economy with stochastic endowment growth, and equity claims the output. This tractable structure does not contain every household's income or borrowing constraints. Its difficulty is not a rejection of all economic models."},reference:{url:"https://academicwebpages.com/preview/mehra/pdf/The%20Equity%20Premium%20A%20Puzzle.pdf",label:{zh:"1985年期刊版 · §3 · p. 150",en:"1985 journal article · §3 · p. 150"}}},{title:{zh:"风险厌恶与跨期替代在这里相联系",en:"Risk aversion and intertemporal substitution are linked here"},body:{zh:"原文使用时间可分的恒定相对风险厌恶效用。效用曲率既影响对风险的厌恶，也影响不同时期消费之间的权衡。提高曲率来解释股票溢价，同时会影响模型中的无风险利率；不能只调整一个收益结果而忽略另一个结果。",en:"Time-separable constant-relative-risk-aversion utility links attitudes toward risk and consumption across dates. Increasing curvature to explain the equity premium also changes the implied risk-free rate. One return cannot be adjusted in isolation from the other within this specification."},reference:{url:"https://academicwebpages.com/preview/mehra/pdf/The%20Equity%20Premium%20A%20Puzzle.pdf",label:{zh:"1985年期刊版 · §3 · equation (2)",en:"1985 journal article · §3 · equation (2)"}}},{title:{zh:"支付发生在哪种消费状态更重要",en:"The consumption state of a payoff matters"},body:{zh:"资产支付通过未来与当前边际效用的比率折现，因而支付与消费状态的共同变化进入定价。单独列出资产自身标准差不能完整表达这里的风险。相同大小的支付，若出现在消费更稀缺的状态，对家庭的价值会不同。",en:"Payoffs are discounted using the ratio of future to current marginal utility, making their co-movement with consumption relevant. Standalone return volatility does not fully describe risk in this model. A payoff is valued differently when it arrives in a consumption-scarce state."},reference:{url:"https://academicwebpages.com/preview/mehra/pdf/The%20Equity%20Premium%20A%20Puzzle.pdf",label:{zh:"1985年期刊版 · §3 · equation (5)",en:"1985 journal article · §3 · equation (5)"}}},{title:{zh:"校准消费过程，再考察模型能产生什么",en:"Calibrate consumption, then examine the model's implications"},body:{zh:"论文用两状态增长过程匹配历史人均消费增长的均值、波动和一阶相关，再研究偏好参数下的收益。作者将其描述为定量理论练习，而不是为了找出最佳参数估计。理解这个顺序，有助于区分模型限制与统计拟合优劣。",en:"A two-state growth process matches historical consumption-growth moments before the authors examine implied returns across preference parameters. This is a quantitative theoretical exercise, not simply a search for best-fitting estimates. The distinction separates model restrictions from statistical fit."},reference:{url:"https://academicwebpages.com/preview/mehra/pdf/The%20Equity%20Premium%20A%20Puzzle.pdf",label:{zh:"1985年期刊版 · §4 · p. 154",en:"1985 journal article · §4 · p. 154"}}},{title:{zh:"保留历史样本与模型边界",en:"Keep the historical and model boundaries visible"},body:{zh:"这篇文章的重要性在于明确提出一组模型与历史事实之间的张力，而不是提供今天的合理股票回报率。编辑解读：比较后续习惯形成、长期风险或市场摩擦研究时，应先看改变了哪个假设，再看是否同时解释原来的两个收益对象。",en:"The contribution identifies tension between a model class and historical observations, not today's appropriate equity return. Editorial reading: when comparing later work on habits, long-run risk or frictions, ask which assumption changes and whether both original return objects are explained."},reference:{url:"https://academicwebpages.com/preview/mehra/pdf/The%20Equity%20Premium%20A%20Puzzle.pdf",label:{zh:"1985年期刊版 · §1; §3–4",en:"1985 journal article · §1; §3–4"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"这是一项针对特定偏好与交换经济模型的历史定量检验，不是未来股票溢价预测。结论同时涉及股票和无风险收益，不能仅用单一收益均值解释。",en:"This is a historical quantitative exercise for a specified exchange economy and preferences, not a forecast of future equity premia. It jointly concerns equity and risk-free returns."}};export{e as default};
